      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The Authors, starting from the observation of a case of stenosis of the celiac tripod, caused by compression \"ab estrinseco\", examine the physiopathological, clinical, aetiopathogenetic and therapeutical aspects of the pathology in question. In accordance with medical literature interpretative nosological doubts are also raised which, not with standing the improved research techniques, make it extremely difficult to suggest an accurate surgical procedure."},
